typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:cee097d0-630e-494d-839d-e8340bba8f84\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:cee097d0-630e-494d-839d-e8340bba8f84\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>In the <a href=\"/wiki/Blighted_Village\" title=\"Blighted Village\">Blighted Village</a> at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;26&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;424</span></li></ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Usage\"> Usage </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Reading the journal initiates the quest <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Finish_the_Masterwork_Weapon\" title=\"Finish the Masterwork Weapon\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/22px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/33px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/44px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Finish the Masterwork Weapon\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/22px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Finish_the_Masterwork_Weapon\" title=\"Finish the Masterwork Weapon\">Finish the Masterwork Weapon</a>.</li>\n<li>When closing the book for the first time the reader may say: <i>\"Interesting. I wonder if those blueprints survived.\"</i></li></ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>The pupil surpasses the teacher!\n</p><p><br>\n</p><p>My master weapons are almost complete - there's just one component left. <a href=\"/wiki/Sampson\" title=\"Sampson\">Sampson</a> says the designs are a failure. But what's he know? He can barely see past his own belly.\n</p><p><br>\n</p><p>I stashed the prototypes and blueprints for now. But just you wait, Sampson. Your legend is fading - and a new one will rise in its place.\n</p>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714201003\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.053 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.055 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1786/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 30669/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 7891/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 29/200\nExpensive parser function count: 2/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.011/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 936234/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   42.318      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n100.00%   42.318      1 -total\n 57.19%   24.200      8 Template:Icon_text\n 50.49%   21.367     19 Template:Trim\n 21.42%    9.063      2 Template:Uid\n 16.38%    6.930      3 Template:Icon_link\n 15.16%    6.417      1 Template:Main_only\n 12.56%    5.317      2 Template:Template_style\n 10.79%    4.568      8 Template:Ifempty\n 10.35%    4.378      1 Template:Books\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:12624-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714201003 and revision id 328795. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\n -->\n</div>"}